000100*================================================================
000200* RDMAR  MARINE CARGO RISK DETAIL
000300*        THE 60-BYTE POL-RISK-DETAIL OF POLREC FOR LINE MAR.
000400*        USED BY RATMAR01.
000500*        policy-admin FILLS THE SAME 60 BYTES IN PRMCOMM
000600*        REQ-RISK-DETAIL WHEN IT CALLS PRMCALC0.
000700*
000800*  CARGO-CLASS     INSTITUTE CARGO CLASS 01-20
000900*  VOYAGE-ZONE     1 COASTAL TO 4 HIGH-RISK WATERS
001000*  REFRIGERATED    Y = REEFER CARGO
001100*  WAR-RISK        Y = WAR AND STRIKES COVER
001200*  CONTAINERISED   Y = CONTAINERISED
001300*================================================================
001400 01  WS-MAR-DETAIL.
001500     05  WS-CARGO-CLASS           PIC 9(02).
001600     05  WS-VOYAGE-ZONE           PIC 9(01).
001700     05  WS-REFRIGERATED          PIC X(01).
001800     05  WS-WAR-RISK              PIC X(01).
001900     05  WS-CONTAINERISED         PIC X(01).
002000     05  FILLER                  PIC X(54).
